  "summary": "Persists and reuses heap storage across blocks in CoinsViewOverlay during parallel prevout prefetching. It keeps the intra-block transaction ID hash set and worker task vector alive across blocks, skips inserting the final transaction ID into the filter, and caps dispatched worker tasks to the queued input count while skipping condition variable notification on empty task lists.",
  "problem": "CoinsViewOverlay::StartFetching reallocates and reseeds an unordered_set of transaction IDs and reallocates a task vector for every block connected. It also inserts the block's final transaction ID even though no subsequent transaction can spend it, and it schedules more worker tasks than available inputs when input queues are small.",
